0 FILE jumper-centre.ldr
0 Jumper plate centring a round lens between two studs
0 Name: jumper-centre.ldr
0 Author: ldraw-nova recipe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 // brick: 1 x 2 brick: its studs are 10 LDU either side of the centre
1 15 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3004.dat
0 STEP
0 // jumper: Jumper on both studs; its single stud sits on the centre line
1 15 0 -8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3794b.dat
0 STEP
0 // lens: Round tile centred half a stud off the grid
1 36 0 -16 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 98138.dat
0 NOFILE
